---
layout: base.njk
title: "Our Story — Camwyn & Co"
description: "Some companies begin with a plan. Ours began with curiosity, family, and the belief that the best work still feels personal."
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="u-py-section u-border-bottom" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Our point of view</p>
    <h1 id="story-title" class="c-hero__title">Built by people who know how to build things.</h1>

    <div class="o-grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-xl); align-items: start;">
      <div style="grid-column: span 7;">
        <p class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Camwyn &amp; Co. grew out of something we had already been doing for years: <span class="u-text-clay">building.</span>
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Sometimes that meant businesses. Other times it meant software, farms, brands, systems, websites, publications, products, or an idea scribbled down at the kitchen table that eventually became something real. And very often, it meant rebuilding.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
          We are Stephen and Ivy Page, a husband-and-wife team with very different brains and a shared habit of looking at something and asking: <em>How could this work better?</em>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="grid-column: span 5; border-left: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding-left: var(--space-lg);">
        <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Our operating dynamic</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-md);">
          <div>
            <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Stephen</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-primary);">
              Sees the structure—technology, systems, operations, and the thousand small behind-the-scenes details that make an idea function.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Ivy</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-primary);">
              Sees the connections—strategy, story, brand, and creative direction. Finding the signal inside the mess and deciding what matters.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Callout Quote Section -->
<section class="u-py-section u-bg-warm-sand u-border-bottom">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div class="o-grid" style="align-items: center;">
      <div style="grid-column: span 8; grid-offset: 3;">
        <blockquote style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--space-md); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-primary);">
          <p class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
            “One of us asks, ‘How do we build it and make it last?’ The other asks, ‘What could it become and how do we get there?’ Camwyn &amp; Co. lives somewhere in between.”
          </p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Turning What You Know Into What Works -->
<section class="u-py-section u-border-bottom" aria-labelledby="approach-heading">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div class="o-grid" style="align-items: start; margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);">
      <div style="grid-column: span 6;">
        <h2 id="approach-heading" class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Turning what you know into something that works.
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          There is an entire industry built around making business sound harder than it needs to be. That has never interested us much. We aren't interested in making things complicated.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
          Most people who come to us already know their trade, their customers, their community, and the problem they are trying to solve. What they often need is someone who can stand beside them, look at the whole picture, and help turn what they know into something that works.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="grid-column: span 6; padding-left: var(--space-lg);">
        <div style="border: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding: var(--space-lg); background: var(--color-surface-container-low);">
          <p class="c-hero__eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">Our Core Disciplines</p>
          <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-sm);" class="u-font-serif">
            <li style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Strategy</li>
            <li style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Systems</li>
            <li style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Story</li>
            <li style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Solutions</li>
          </ul>
          <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-top: var(--space-md);">
            Not as four separate services, but as parts of the same single problem.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Real Experience Section -->
<section class="u-py-section u-bg-warm-sand u-border-bottom" aria-labelledby="experience-heading">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div class="o-grid" style="align-items: start;">
      <div style="grid-column: span 5;">
        <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Rooted in practice</p>
        <h2 id="experience-heading" class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Camwyn is built from real life.
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
          We didn't learn everything we know sitting in conference rooms. That experience shapes how we think and how we work with others.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="grid-column: span 7; padding-left: var(--space-lg);">
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          We've built businesses, worked in technology, created publications, raised animals, and marketed farm products. We've managed projects, people, websites, customers, deadlines, disasters, and more than a few ideas that sounded slightly ridiculous until they started working.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          We've also watched good ideas fail because the system underneath them wasn't strong enough. We've seen capable people struggle because nobody helped them translate what they knew into a business other people could understand. And we've learned that the best solution isn't always the biggest, newest, or most expensive one—sometimes it is simply the right one.
        </p>
        
        <div class="o-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-md); margin-top: var(--space-lg); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-outline-variant); padding-top: var(--space-md);">
          <div>
            <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Practical</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">Because we’ve had to be.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Creative</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">Because there isn't always an obvious answer.</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600;">Durable</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">Because we value things worth keeping.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Looking Forward Section -->
<section class="u-py-section" aria-labelledby="forward-heading">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div class="o-grid" style="align-items: start;">
      <div style="grid-column: span 6;">
        <h2 id="forward-heading" class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Built for what comes next.
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Camwyn &amp; Co. is intentionally broad because our work has never fit neatly into one box. Business changes, technology changes, communities change, and good ideas evolve. Our job is not to sell someone a predetermined answer.
        </p>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
          We work especially well in the space between <em>“I know there is something here”</em> and <em>“Now, how do we actually make it work?”</em> We don't believe good leadership means pretending you know everything—it means knowing what needs to happen next and knowing who should be at the table to make it happen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="grid-column: span 6; padding-left: var(--space-lg);">
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Sometimes it starts with a conversation. Sometimes it starts with a problem someone has been staring at for six months. And sometimes it starts with the sentence we have heard—and said—more times than we can count:
        </p>
        <p class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-primary); line-height: 1.3; margin-top: var(--space-md);">
          “There has to be a better way to do this.”
        </p>
        <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text); margin-top: 0.5rem;">
          Usually, there is. That’s where Camwyn &amp; Co. begins.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Partnering Section -->
<section class="u-py-section u-bg-warm-sand u-border-bottom" aria-labelledby="partner-heading">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide" 
       x-data="{
         archetype: null,
         partnerships: {
           catalyst: 'When you join the workshop as a <strong class=\'u-text-clay\'>Catalyst</strong>, we turn your kinetic energy and cross-pollinated ideas into durable, living systems before momentum fades.',
           craftsman: 'When you join the workshop as a <strong class=\'u-text-clay\'>Craftsman</strong>, we honor the grain of your work, refining fine lines and structural joints so your ideas hold weight for the long haul.',
           explorer: 'When you join the workshop as an <strong class=\'u-text-clay\'>Explorer</strong>, we build stable scaffolding around your curiosity, mapping uncharted lanes without forcing you onto a predictable grid.',
           gatherer: 'When you join the workshop as a <strong class=\'u-text-clay\'>Gatherer</strong>, we turn solitary efforts into hospitable spaces, ensuring your table is built on durable foundations.',
           storykeeper: 'When you join the workshop as a <strong class=\'u-text-clay\'>Storykeeper</strong>, we archive the human origin behind your work, giving the next generation a foundation rather than an empty room.'
         },
         init() {
           try {
             this.archetype = Alpine.store('compass')?.result || localStorage.getItem('compassResult') || null;
           } catch(e) {}
         }
       }">
    <div class="c-partnering-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Shared Momentum</p>
        <h2 id="partner-heading" class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2.25rem; color: var(--color-primary);">
          How We Partner with You
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="c-partnering-layout__content">
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Stephen brings deep architectural craft and structural durability; Ivy brings storytelling, brand clarity, and generous gathering.
        </p>
        <p class="u-font-serif" 
           style="font-size: 1.375rem; line-height: 1.4; color: var(--color-primary);"
           x-html="archetype && partnerships[archetype] ? partnerships[archetype] : 'When you pull up a chair to our table, we combine strategy, systems, and story to turn what you know into <span class=\'u-text-clay\'>something that truly works.</span>'">
        </p>
        
        <template x-if="!archetype">
          <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text); margin-top: var(--space-sm);">
            <a href="/#your-compass" style="color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: underline;">Take the 5-question compass quiz</a> to personalize your dynamic partnership prompt.
          </p>
        </template>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Workshop Table & Archetype Chemistry Grid -->
<script>
  window.__CHEMISTRY_PAIRINGS__ = {{ chemistry.pairings | dump | safe }};
</script>

<section 
  class="c-chemistry-section" 
  id="workshop-table" 
  aria-labelledby="workshop-table-heading"
  x-data="{
    archetypeA: 'craftsman',
    archetypeB: 'gatherer',
    activeFilter: 'all',
    userArchetype: null,
    pairings: window.__CHEMISTRY_PAIRINGS__ || {},
    archetypeNames: {
      gatherer: 'The Gatherer',
      craftsman: 'The Craftsman',
      explorer: 'The Explorer',
      catalyst: 'The Catalyst',
      storykeeper: 'The Storykeeper'
    },
    archetypeIcons: {
      gatherer: 'leaf',
      craftsman: 'brush',
      explorer: 'compass',
      catalyst: 'wand',
      storykeeper: 'shield'
    },
    getCanonicalKey(a, b) {
      const sorted = [a, b].sort();
      return sorted[0] + '+' + sorted[1];
    },
    get currentPairing() {
      const key = this.getCanonicalKey(this.archetypeA, this.archetypeB);
      return (this.pairings && this.pairings[key]) ? this.pairings[key] : (this.pairings ? this.pairings['craftsman+gatherer'] : {});
    },
    selectDuo(a, b) {
      this.archetypeA = a;
      this.archetypeB = b;
    },
    init() {
      try {
        const saved = (this.$store?.compass?.result || localStorage.getItem('compassResult') || '').toLowerCase();
        if (['gatherer', 'craftsman', 'explorer', 'catalyst', 'storykeeper'].includes(saved)) {
          this.userArchetype = saved;
          this.archetypeA = saved;
          this.archetypeB = saved === 'craftsman' ? 'gatherer' : (saved === 'gatherer' ? 'craftsman' : 'craftsman');
          this.activeFilter = 'user';
        }
      } catch (e) {}
    },
    matchesFilter(archA, archB, isDouble) {
      if (this.activeFilter === 'all') return true;
      if (this.activeFilter === 'doubles') return isDouble;
      if (this.activeFilter === 'user') {
        if (!this.userArchetype) return true;
        return archA === this.userArchetype || archB === this.userArchetype;
      }
      return archA === this.activeFilter || archB === this.activeFilter;
    }
  }"
>
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div class="c-chemistry-intro">
      <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">The Collaborative Equation</p>
      <h2 id="workshop-table-heading" class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);">
        At the Workshop Table
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); max-width: 48rem;">
        Every worthwhile adventure requires more than one perspective. Explore the collaborative chemistry when two distinct instincts sit side by side—how they spark, where they friction, and the enduring things they build together.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Interactive Duo Builder & Result Card -->
    <div class="c-chemistry-interactive">
      <!-- Selector Panel -->
      <div class="c-chemistry-builder">
        <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
          Pair Any Two Instincts
        </h3>

        <!-- Person 1 Selector -->
        <div class="c-chemistry-picker-group">
          <span class="c-chemistry-picker-label">
            First Instinct (e.g. You)
            <template x-if="userArchetype">
              <span style="color: var(--color-muted-clay-text); text-transform: none; margin-left: 0.25rem;">(Active Compass detected)</span>
            </template>
          </span>
          <div class="c-chemistry-pills" role="group" aria-label="Select first archetype">
            {% for key, arch in compass.archetypes %}
              <button 
                type="button" 
                class="c-chemistry-pill" 
                :class="{ 'is-active': archetypeA === '{{ key }}' }"
                @click="archetypeA = '{{ key }}'"
                :aria-pressed="archetypeA === '{{ key }}'"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <img src="/assets/{{ arch.icon }}.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="c-chemistry-pill__icon" width="14" height="14" />
                <span>{{ arch.name }}</span>
              </button>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Person 2 Selector -->
        <div class="c-chemistry-picker-group">
          <span class="c-chemistry-picker-label">Second Instinct (Collaborator)</span>
          <div class="c-chemistry-pills" role="group" aria-label="Select collaborator archetype">
            {% for key, arch in compass.archetypes %}
              <button 
                type="button" 
                class="c-chemistry-pill" 
                :class="{ 'is-active': archetypeB === '{{ key }}' }"
                @click="archetypeB = '{{ key }}'"
                :aria-pressed="archetypeB === '{{ key }}'"
                aria-pressed="false"
              >
                <img src="/assets/{{ arch.icon }}.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="c-chemistry-pill__icon" width="14" height="14" />
                <span>{{ arch.name }}</span>
              </button>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Featured Chemistry Profile -->
      <div class="c-chemistry-hero-card" aria-live="polite">
        <div class="c-chemistry-hero-card__header">
          <div class="c-chemistry-hero-card__duo-icons">
            <div class="c-chemistry-hero-card__icon-badge">
              <img :src="'/assets/' + (archetypeIcons[currentPairing.archetypeA] || 'brush') + '.svg'" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" />
              <span x-text="archetypeNames[currentPairing.archetypeA] || 'The Craftsman'">The Craftsman</span>
            </div>
            <span class="c-chemistry-hero-card__plus">+</span>
            <div class="c-chemistry-hero-card__icon-badge">
              <img :src="'/assets/' + (archetypeIcons[currentPairing.archetypeB] || 'leaf') + '.svg'" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" />
              <span x-text="archetypeNames[currentPairing.archetypeB] || 'The Gatherer'">The Gatherer</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <span class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text);" x-text="currentPairing.isDouble ? '★ Double Synergy' : 'Reciprocal Chemistry'">Reciprocal Chemistry</span>
        </div>

        <h3 class="c-chemistry-hero-card__title" x-text="currentPairing.title || 'The Kitchen Table'">The Kitchen Table</h3>
        <p class="c-chemistry-hero-card__tagline" x-text="currentPairing.tagline || 'Carefully built environments designed for generous living.'">Carefully built environments designed for generous living.</p>
        <p class="c-chemistry-hero-card__body" x-text="currentPairing.chemistry || 'The core founding chemistry of Camwyn & Co. Stephen builds the sturdy white-oak table; Ivy fills it with food, laughter, and open conversation. Structural integrity meets deep human connection.'">The core founding chemistry of Camwyn &amp; Co. Stephen builds the sturdy white-oak table; Ivy fills it with food, laughter, and open conversation. Structural integrity meets deep human connection.</p>

        <div class="c-chemistry-hero-card__insights">
          <div class="c-chemistry-insight-box">
            <span class="c-chemistry-insight-box__label">⚡ Where Friction Sparks</span>
            <p class="c-chemistry-insight-box__text" x-text="currentPairing.watchOut || 'The Craftsman may retreat into the workshop when the house gets full; the Gatherer must remember to protect the Craftsman\'s quiet making hours.'">The Craftsman may retreat into the workshop when the house gets full; the Gatherer must remember to protect the Craftsman's quiet making hours.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="c-chemistry-insight-box">
            <span class="c-chemistry-insight-box__label">🎯 Sweet Spot &amp; Venture Fit</span>
            <p class="c-chemistry-insight-box__text" x-text="currentPairing.idealProject || 'Hospitality spaces, heirloom workshops, family ventures, and atelier studios.'">Hospitality spaces, heirloom workshops, family ventures, and atelier studios.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Complete 15-Pairing Catalog Grid -->
    <div class="c-chemistry-catalog">
      <div class="c-chemistry-catalog-header">
        <div>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">
            Explore All 15 Combinations
          </h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);">
            Click any pairing card below to load its full collaborative spec.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Filter Controls -->
        <div class="o-cluster" style="gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;" role="group" aria-label="Filter chemistry pairings">
          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="c-btn"
            :class="activeFilter === 'all' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
            @click="activeFilter = 'all'"
            style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
          >
            <span>All 15</span>
          </button>
          
          <template x-if="userArchetype">
            <button 
              type="button" 
              class="c-btn"
              :class="activeFilter === 'user' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
              @click="activeFilter = 'user'"
              style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
            >
              <span>My Pairings (5)</span>
            </button>
          </template>

          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="c-btn"
            :class="activeFilter === 'doubles' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
            @click="activeFilter = 'doubles'"
            style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
          >
            <span>Doubles (5)</span>
          </button>

          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="c-btn"
            :class="activeFilter === 'craftsman' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
            @click="activeFilter = 'craftsman'"
            style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
          >
            <img src="/assets/brush.svg" class="c-btn__icon" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" />
            <span>Craftsman</span>
          </button>

          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="c-btn"
            :class="activeFilter === 'gatherer' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
            @click="activeFilter = 'gatherer'"
            style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
          >
            <img src="/assets/leaf.svg" class="c-btn__icon" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" />
            <span>Gatherer</span>
          </button>

          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="c-btn"
            :class="activeFilter === 'explorer' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
            @click="activeFilter = 'explorer'"
            style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
          >
            <img src="/assets/compass.svg" class="c-btn__icon" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" />
            <span>Explorer</span>
          </button>

          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="c-btn"
            :class="activeFilter === 'catalyst' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
            @click="activeFilter = 'catalyst'"
            style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
          >
            <img src="/assets/wand.svg" class="c-btn__icon" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" />
            <span>Catalyst</span>
          </button>

          <button 
            type="button" 
            class="c-btn"
            :class="activeFilter === 'storykeeper' ? 'c-btn--primary' : 'c-btn--secondary'"
            @click="activeFilter = 'storykeeper'"
            style="padding: 0.375rem 0.75rem; font-size: 0.6875rem; min-height: 36px;"
          >
            <img src="/assets/shield.svg" class="c-btn__icon" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12" />
            <span>Storykeeper</span>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="c-chemistry-grid">
        {% for key, pair in chemistry.pairings %}
          <div 
            class="c-chemistry-card"
            :class="{
              'is-active': getCanonicalKey(archetypeA, archetypeB) === '{{ key }}',
              'c-chemistry-card--user-promoted': userArchetype && ('{{ pair.archetypeA }}' === userArchetype || '{{ pair.archetypeB }}' === userArchetype)
            }"
            x-show="matchesFilter('{{ pair.archetypeA }}', '{{ pair.archetypeB }}', {{ 'true' if pair.isDouble else 'false' }})"
            @click="selectDuo('{{ pair.archetypeA }}', '{{ pair.archetypeB }}'); document.getElementById('workshop-table').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });"
            role="button"
            tabindex="0"
            @keydown.enter="selectDuo('{{ pair.archetypeA }}', '{{ pair.archetypeB }}'); document.getElementById('workshop-table').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });"
            @keydown.space.prevent="selectDuo('{{ pair.archetypeA }}', '{{ pair.archetypeB }}'); document.getElementById('workshop-table').scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'start' });"
            aria-label="Explore chemistry for {{ pair.title }}"
          >
            <div>
              <div class="c-chemistry-card__badge" x-show="userArchetype && ('{{ pair.archetypeA }}' === userArchetype || '{{ pair.archetypeB }}' === userArchetype)">
                <span>✦ Resonates with Your Compass</span>
              </div>
              <div class="c-chemistry-card__duo">
                <img src="/assets/{{ compass.archetypes[pair.archetypeA].icon }}.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" />
                <span class="u-font-mono" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">{{ compass.archetypes[pair.archetypeA].name }}</span>
                <span class="u-font-mono" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text);">+</span>
                <img src="/assets/{{ compass.archetypes[pair.archetypeB].icon }}.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" />
                <span class="u-font-mono" style="font-size: 0.75rem;">{{ compass.archetypes[pair.archetypeB].name }}</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="c-chemistry-card__title">{{ pair.title }}</h4>
              <p class="c-chemistry-card__tagline">{{ pair.tagline }}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="c-chemistry-card__footer">
              <span>{{ 'Double Synergy' if pair.isDouble else 'Reciprocal Duo' }}</span>
              <span>Inspect Specimen →</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
